<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia labour market trend soft - Vanstone.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia labour market trend soft - Vanstone.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanstone said on Thursday the underlying trend of the labour market remains soft.</p>
<p>Vanstone said the labour market needed a &quot;significant kick start&quot;, which she said she hoped would come from business.</p>
</text>
